          "body": "For the two faces with base \\(2x\\), the slant height is\n\n\\[\n\\sqrt{(5x)^2+\\left(\\frac x2\\right)^2}\n=\\frac{x\\sqrt{101}}2\n\\]"
        },
        {
          "title": "Their total area is",
          "body": "Their total area is\n\n\\[\n2\\left(\\frac12(2x)\\cdot\\frac{x\\sqrt{101}}2\\right)=x^2\\sqrt{101}\n\\]"
        },
        {
          "title": "Total surface area",
          "body": "Total surface area:\n\n\\[\n2x^2+x^2\\sqrt{26}+x^2\\sqrt{101}\n\\]"
        },
        {
          "title": "Substitute",
          "body": "Substitute \\(x=12\\):\n\n\\[\n144(2+\\sqrt{26}+\\sqrt{101})=2469.440\\ldots\n\\]"
